Privacy Policy for Minimalist

Last updated: November 19, 2026

Minimalist is a Wear OS watch face. We respect your privacy and are committed to protecting user information.

1. Information Collection

Minimalist does not collect, store, transmit, or share personal or sensitive user data.

The watch face uses system-provided time and date information to display the current time and date. This information is processed locally on your device.

2. Data Storage

Watch face customization preferences, such as color selections, are managed locally through the Wear OS system.

We do not operate servers that store user information.

3. Data Sharing

Minimalist does not share personal or sensitive user data with third parties.

4. Advertising and Analytics

Minimalist does not contain advertisements, analytics services, or user-tracking technologies.

5. Data Retention and Deletion

We do not collect or retain personal user data. Therefore, we have no personal user data to delete from our servers.

Users can uninstall the watch face through their device or Google Play.

6. Changes to This Privacy Policy

We may update this Privacy Policy when necessary. Any changes will be published on this page with an updated revision date.